# The API key for the Last.fm API account this extension reads artist, album and
# track info with. Create one at <https://www.last.fm/api/account/create>.
#
# This is optional: without a key Liner Notes still shows what MusicBrainz and
# Wikipedia know, it just leaves out Last.fm's bios, tags and listener counts.
#
# Note: like every other `VITE_` value, this is bundled into the extension and
# is therefore readable by anyone who can load it.
VITE_LASTFM_API_KEY=""
